{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_BFECED86","title":"Ptolemy 3","entry":"Dlg_BFECED86::entry","exit":"Dlg_BFECED86::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_77B270E0","articyId":"72057752951728628","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"But no, here you stand, real, physical, and, dare I say, aching for a little organic stimulation.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But no, here you stand, real, physical, and, dare I say, aching for a little organic stimulation.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":250.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21803","byteOffset":16137816,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_0104129A","articyId":"72057752951741833","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Want? Oh, sweet thing, it’s not about what I want—it’s about what you need. And what you need… is a good, old-fashioned, analogue experience.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Want? Oh, sweet thing, it’s not about what I want—it’s about what you need. And what you need… is a good, old-fashioned, analogue experience.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":875.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45439","byteOffset":31523432,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_BAE400F8","articyId":"72057752951741847","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"I like how they feel in my mouth.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I like how they feel in my mouth.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":875.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20796","byteOffset":15751384,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_44B132A5","articyId":"72057752951741855","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Behold! The latest edition of my Ana-Blog! Hot off the...well, technically lukewarm off my fingertips. Handwritten, untraceable, and absolutely dripping with substance.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Behold! The latest edition of my Ana-Blog! Hot off the...well, technically lukewarm off my fingertips. Handwritten, untraceable, and absolutely dripping with substance.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34091","byteOffset":20779304,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_DE7AD0B5","articyId":"72057752951741869","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Oh, don’t be coy. You know exactly what I mean. Sweat, effort, the unmistakable musk of a mind working without a neural uplink. It’s raw. It’s real. And it’s just waiting to be touched. Go on, touch it.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh, don’t be coy. You know exactly what I mean. Sweat, effort, the unmistakable musk of a mind working without a neural uplink. It’s raw. It’s real. And it’s just waiting to be touched. Go on, touch it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38009","byteOffset":28714408,"byteLength":592}},{"id":"DFr_D2A12D71","articyId":"72057752951741890","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Ohhh, I see how it is. You're afraid. Afraid of feeling something real. Afraid that these little squiggles of ink might touch you in a way your sterile little data feeds never could.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ohhh, I see how it is. You're afraid. Afraid of feeling something real. Afraid that these little squiggles of ink might touch you in a way your sterile little data feeds never could.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2725.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48929","byteOffset":32851680,"byteLength":528}},{"id":"DFr_CCF07B73","articyId":"72057752951741904","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Ah-ha! I knew it. A deep, primal fear, etched into your very soul. You stare at these little ink-stained curves and lines, and somewhere inside, a tiny voice whispers… What if they change me?","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah-ha! I knew it. A deep, primal fear, etched into your very soul. You stare at these little ink-stained curves and lines, and somewhere inside, a tiny voice whispers… What if they change me?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50131","byteOffset":33307480,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_D8486179","articyId":"72057752951741931","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Look, I know I come on a little strong sometimes. it's just passion. I know this Tech-Skep stuff is a little mad. It's not just about the message it's about the community.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I know I come on a little strong sometimes. it's just passion. I know this Tech-Skep stuff is a little mad. It's not just about the message it's about the community.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3400.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30503","byteOffset":19420376,"byteLength":516}},{"id":"DFr_4C8AA760","articyId":"72057752951741952","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Look, I know you mean 'cult' in a bad way, but what if you also look at it in a good way?","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Look, I know you mean 'cult' in a bad way, but what if you also look at it in a good way?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47833","byteOffset":32430568,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_39B8A7B5","articyId":"72057752951741966","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"It's all in the Ana-Blog. Give it a look","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's all in the Ana-Blog. Give it a look","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4800.0,"y":175.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26628","byteOffset":17953672,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_7767D443","articyId":"72057752951741974","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"I'm not an idiot, I know that nobody reads this stuff yet, but you were there from day one. You're as invested in this as I am.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not an idiot, I know that nobody reads this stuff yet, but you were there from day one. You're as invested in this as I am.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41657","byteOffset":30088104,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_6EF20C2A","articyId":"72057752951741989","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Here, take a look. I think you might find something you're looking for.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Here, take a look. I think you might find something you're looking for.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4100.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46600","byteOffset":31962072,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_F0FDAF81","articyId":"72057821671320566","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ptolemy","text":"Ah-ha! There you are, my little screen-addicted cherub. I was starting to think you’d succumbed the digital void.","speakerId":"Ntt_26BC379F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah-ha! There you are, my little screen-addicted cherub. I was starting to think you’d succumbed the digital void.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-50.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38097","byteOffset":28747344,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_FD5D8DDA","articyId":"72057752951741819","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What do you want, Ptolemy?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What do you want, Ptolemy?","TextSheVersion":"What do you want, Ptolemy?","TextTheyVersion":"What do you want, Ptolemy?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":575.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25062","byteOffset":17364328,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_96ACBA3E","articyId":"72057752951741826","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You have a real way with words.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You have a real way with words.","TextSheVersion":"You have a real way with words.","TextTheyVersion":"You have a real way with words."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":575.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24355","byteOffset":17089976,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_9C5C1FAD","articyId":"72057752951741840","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So you're still working on the Ana-blog?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So you're still working on the Ana-blog?","TextSheVersion":"So you're still working on the Ana-blog?","TextTheyVersion":"So you're still working on the Ana-blog?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47711","byteOffset":32385936,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_26FE11BB","articyId":"72057752951741862","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Dripping with what now?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Dripping with what now?","TextSheVersion":"Dripping with what now?","TextTheyVersion":"Dripping with what now?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32270","byteOffset":20087896,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_0593DFCE","articyId":"72057752951741876","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'd rather not...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'd rath